---
---

<header class="app-header">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="logo-icon">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-text">
      <h1>دستیار هوشمند کریپتو <span class="badge-agno">Agno 2.0</span></h1>
      <p class="subtitle">تحلیل تکنیکال و درون زنجیره‌ای (On-Chain) با ایجنت‌های هوشمند</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="header-actions">
    <div class="status-indicator glass-card">
      <span class="pulsing-dot"></span>
      <span class="status-text">موتور ایجنت فعال است</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .app-header {
    height: 70px;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    direction: rtl;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .logo-icon {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-cyan), var(--accent-purple));
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
  }

  .brand-text h1 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .badge-agno {
    background: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .header-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .status-indicator {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
</style>
